# Generated project
# Note: FoodieAI.xcodeproj is checked in (generated by xcodegen from project.yml).
# Regenerate with: `xcodegen generate`

# The dishes.jsonl in Resources/Data/ is a COPY of ../data/dishes/dishes.jsonl.
# We keep it in the bundle so xcodegen can include it as a resource.
# To update: `cp ../data/dishes/dishes.jsonl FoodieAI/Resources/Data/dishes.jsonl`
